# Logo: UCBLogo (Berkeley Logo) user manual; requirements/languages/logo.md
name     logo ucblogo
keyword  to end repeat if ifelse make local output stop for while foreach
builtin  forward fd back bk left lt right rt penup pu pendown pd print show sum product first butfirst
builtin  random clearscreen cs home
fold-case
line-comment   ;
sigil    :    : attr
sigil    "    : str
operators  +-*/=<>[]()
